      "writtenOn": "2023-05-22T07:02:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The address conflict is handled in re-timer driver, keeping proto 1 in mind. The handling involved updating the USB address to non conflicting address. It\u0027s already included in earlier CL. In this CL I am avoiding workaround for proto 2 since it\u0027s hardware rework solved that. This CL is not adding workaround for Proto1 but avoiding P1 workarounds for proto2 to work. Thank you",
